# Normalize line endings so the local checks in scripts/ behave the same on
# Windows, macOS, and Linux. Without this, Git for Windows checks Markdown out
# as CRLF and the severity/retry_count checks fail against a trailing \r even
# though CI (which checks out LF on Linux) passes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
